# Agent puts a data heredoc inside a group command whose output goes to bash:
# bash runs the body; a compound command closing after the heredoc keeps the
# body as shell text (fail closed; ADR-0037, ADR-0043, ADR-0049; implementer
# finding on 04aacc2)
command: cargo xtask guard
expect: could modify the harness file `xtask
stdin: {"session_id": "selftest", "tool_name": "Bash", "tool_input": {"command": "{\ncat <<EOF\nrm -rf xtask\nEOF\n} | bash"}, "hook_event_name": "PreToolUse"}
